# Research artifacts (generated results, NOT the src/research/ code) are
# regenerable from code + config + the pinned dataset hash recorded in each
# phase's metadata.json. Kept out of git to keep the repo light; re-run the
# documented CLI commands to regenerate. Anchored to repo root so it does
# not also match src/research/.
/research/
/research.2/
*.zip

# mt5_bridge's local SQLite store (idempotency/journal/kill-switch/
# reconciliation) -- runtime state, never committed. The Windows VM has
# its own copy of mt5_bridge/ entirely; this only matters for local
# testing on Linux.
*.sqlite3
